# Run 2026-11-01, client block, priority rows (scratch_queue.md "Priority run" client session and CQ-PRI-01 to -04).
# World QA_A1 = copy of r11p1 (superflat, the priority boot-1 world plus the r1031 look targets rebuilt).
# qrun.py client GAME tools/scratch_query/batches/r1101/c0_priority.qb RES; run BEFORE r1031/c1_client.qb.
# Client jars: instance mods/ plus the 01:56 patcherMod and Creative Delight builds hard-linked into GAME/mods.
pace 2

## CQ-R11-BOOT | client boot and world join clean
bootexpect Sound engine started|FIRST_CLIENT_TICK
bootreject (Mixin apply failed|InvalidInjectionException).*(creativeengineering|creative_delight|creative_brewing|blockheads_additions)
sleep 5
> gamemode creative
> time set noon
> gamerule doDaylightCycle false
> gamerule doWeatherCycle false
> weather clear
shot joined

