> tp @s 202.5 -60 2.5 180 30
shot ice
> tp @s 204.5 -60 2.5 180 30
shot grass
> tp @s 206.5 -60 2.5 180 30
shot iron_ore
> tp @s 208.5 -60 2.5 180 30
shot stone
> tp @s 210.5 -60 2.5 180 30
